  "duration_s": 496.628005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们说到清华校长梅宜奇穷到跟夫人摆地摊卖点心，手里却管着千万清华基金。他那个从不离身的旧皮包，谁也不知道里面装着什么。一九六二年五月十九日，梅遗奇在台北台大医院病逝。他病重期间，那个皮包一直锁在病床底下，谁也不让碰。去世之后，梅秘书当场把皮包家封，又组织专门的人在各方监督下起封查验包。打开的那一刻，所有人都愣住了，没有银票，没有贵重财物，没有存款，连一张私人的字据都没有，里面整整齐齐码着的全是清华基金的账本，一笔一笔从他一九三一年当校长开始，到一九六二年去世十几年的账，每一一笔钱什么时候到的，用在了什么地方，还剩多少，记得密密麻麻，清清爽爽，分毫不差。在场的人没有一个不掉眼泪的他，管了一辈子清华的钱。一九四九年，他到美国管理清华庚款基金，巨额资金从手上经过，当时在美留学生每人每月资助三百美元。他给自己定的月薪也是三百美元，一分不多拿。有人看不下去，说你是校长，怎么能跟学生拿一样多，要给他涨到一千五百元。他不同意，说薪水是我自己定的，我不情愿改他租的公寓，小到连一间单独的卧室都没有。他夫人韩永华呢六十二岁才开始在美国找工作，衣帽厂做过工首饰店卖过货，医院里做过护工，最后在一所盲童学校照料盲童，一直干到六十六岁才退休。他自己呢住院的时候连医药费都付不起，去世后丧葬费都是清华校友凑的这就是梅一期，他不是没钱，他是把钱全给了学校，给了学生，一分钱没往自己兜里装。再说他怎么用人，那才叫真正的不拘一格。华罗庚什么学历？初中毕业在江苏金坛老家的药费殿伙计，一边站柜台，一边自学数学。就这么一个人，梅一其看上了，先把他破格招进清华，又破格从一个系资料员直接升为助教，还允许他旁听大学课程，再破格送到英国剑桥大学深造。最后这一步，最难得跳过讲师副教授直接聘为正教授。一个初中毕业的店员，在每一期手里一步步变成了世界级的数学大师，还有陈寅恪留学多年，没有学位，没有著作，在国内也没什么名气，典型的三无学者没一齐主持。清华教务期间，陈寅恪被聘为清华国学研究院导师和王国维、梁启超、赵元任并称四大导师。后来，傅斯年评价陈寅恪说，他是近三百年来一人而已。每一期常说一句话，所谓大学者，非未有大楼之谓，也有大师之谓也。翻译过来就是一个大学，行不行？不看你楼盖多高，看你有没有好老师。他不光这么说，他真这么干。教授开会，他搬个凳子坐墙角，不说话，手里摆弄个烟斗，看谁茶杯空了，起身给人续上水。有人问他校长有什么指示，他摆摆手说你们都是专家，你们定的是我去办就完了，就这么一个给教授搬板凳的校长。在抗战最艰难的时候，带着清华北大南开三所学校一路南迁，到昆明组成了西南联合大学。那学校破到什么程度？请了梁思成林徽因来设计校舍，图纸改了一稿又一稿，高楼改矮楼，矮楼改平房，砖墙改土墙。最后建起来的是一排排茅草屋，宿舍是茅草顶，教室是铁皮顶。昆明一下雨，雨点打在铁皮上，噼里啪啦老师在讲台上喊破嗓子，学生一个字听不见。有一次，经济系教授陈戴孙上课，暴雨突至，什么都听不清了。陈先生转过身在黑板上写了四个字，停客赏语，全班师生就这么静静的坐着。听外面的雨声就是这么一所破破烂烂，连个像样的教室都没有的大学，只存在了短短八年，创造了什么奇迹？两位诺贝尔物理学奖得主杨振宁、李政道八位、两弹一星功勋奖章获得者、五位，国家最高科学技术奖得主一百七十多位两院院士，还有上百位人文社科大师汪曾祺许愿冲邓稼先。一个个名字到今天，念起来都沉甸甸的。中国教育史上的珠穆朗玛峰是在茅草屋里，铁皮顶下战乱中，被梅一齐带着一群人扛起来的。一九六一年，梅一齐因为重病住进台大医院特二号病房，隔壁特一号病房住的是谁？胡适，一个曾经主持北大，一个长期主持清华两位老校长，晚年住进了一墙之隔的两个病房。一九六二年二月，胡适先走了不到三个月，五月十九日，梅一起也走了。他去世后，两岸、清华各建了一座梅园。每年冬天，新竹的梅花开了，北京的梅园里也常有师生驻足。现在咱们的大学楼越盖越高，设备越来越先进，经费越来越多可。有时候我就想，我们到底缺什么，我们缺的不是大楼，不是经费，是梅一齐身上那点东西，那点儿，把公家的钱当命看，把自己的日子当草过，把人才当天大的事儿，把原则当命根子的劲儿。他用一辈子告诉后人，什么都可以向现实低头，唯独读书人的风骨。不能。如果你也被梅校长的故事戳到了，想知道那批读书人在战火里到底是怎么活过来，怎么把书教下去的。我真心推荐你看看。南渡北归、这套书、梅一齐陈银雀、华罗庚、梁思成林徽因，还有西南联大那批先生们，书里写的比我讲的细多了。那不是一个人的故事，是整整一代中国读书人在乱世里的群像。他们住茅草屋，吃白饭拌辣椒，可脊梁骨挺的比谁都直。看完你就明白，为什么那所破破烂烂的大学能走出那么多大师。感兴趣的朋友们可以点左下角链接，直接拍，拿到手。细细品读关注我，带你看更多有骨气的中国人，觉得梅校长值得被记住的点个赞。收藏起来，评论区告诉我，你最佩服他哪一点，再转发出去，让更多人知道中国曾经有过这样的校长。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 590,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00002",
      "start_ms": 610,
      "end_ms": 6350,
      "text": "咱们说到清华校长梅宜奇穷到跟夫人摆地摊卖点心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6910,
      "end_ms": 9550,
      "text": "手里却管着千万清华基金。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10050,
      "end_ms": 12350,
      "text": "他那个从不离身的旧皮包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12730,
      "end_ms": 14750,
      "text": "谁也不知道里面装着什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15230,
      "end_ms": 17030,
      "text": "一九六二年五月十九日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17710,
      "end_ms": 20730,
      "text": "梅遗奇在台北台大医院病逝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00008",
      "start_ms": 21570,
      "end_ms": 22830,
      "text": "他病重期间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23250,
      "end_ms": 25890,
      "text": "那个皮包一直锁在病床底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25890,
      "end_ms": 27390,
      "text": "谁也不让碰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00011",
      "start_ms": 27390,
      "end_ms": 29310,
      "text": "去世之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29310,
      "end_ms": 32200,
      "text": "梅秘书当场把皮包家封，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00013",
      "start_ms": 32640,
      "end_ms": 37580,
      "text": "又组织专门的人在各方监督下起封查验包。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00014",
      "start_ms": 37640,
      "end_ms": 38660,
      "text": "打开的那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00015",
      "start_ms": 38960,
      "end_ms": 40340,
      "text": "所有人都愣住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00016",
      "start_ms": 40940,
      "end_ms": 41780,
      "text": "没有银票，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00017",
      "start_ms": 42000,
      "end_ms": 43280,
      "text": "没有贵重财物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00018",
      "start_ms": 43400,
      "end_ms": 44300,
      "text": "没有存款，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00019",
      "start_ms": 44540,
      "end_ms": 46800,
      "text": "连一张私人的字据都没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00020",
      "start_ms": 47240,
      "end_ms": 51220,
      "text": "里面整整齐齐码着的全是清华基金的账本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00021",
      "start_ms": 52000,
      "end_ms": 56020,
      "text": "一笔一笔从他一九三一年当校长开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56240,
      "end_ms": 59140,
      "text": "到一九六二年去世十几年的账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00023",
      "start_ms": 59140,
      "end_ms": 61725,
      "text": "每一一笔钱什么时候到的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00024",
      "start_ms": 62050,
      "end_ms": 63330,
      "text": "用在了什么地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00025",
      "start_ms": 63490,
      "end_ms": 64475,
      "text": "还剩多少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00026",
      "start_ms": 64820,
      "end_ms": 65960,
      "text": "记得密密麻麻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00027",
      "start_ms": 66180,
      "end_ms": 67165,
      "text": "清清爽爽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00028",
      "start_ms": 67500,
      "end_ms": 68340,
      "text": "分毫不差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00029",
      "start_ms": 68540,
      "end_ms": 72340,
      "text": "在场的人没有一个不掉眼泪的他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00030",
      "start_ms": 72340,
      "end_ms": 74295,
      "text": "管了一辈子清华的钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00031",
      "start_ms": 75160,
      "end_ms": 76160,
      "text": "一九四九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00032",
      "start_ms": 76160,
      "end_ms": 78785,
      "text": "他到美国管理清华庚款基金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00033",
      "start_ms": 79260,
      "end_ms": 81835,
      "text": "巨额资金从手上经过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00034",
      "start_ms": 82290,
      "end_ms": 85755,
      "text": "当时在美留学生每人每月资助三百美元。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00035",
      "start_ms": 86160,
      "end_ms": 88760,
      "text": "他给自己定的月薪也是三百美元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00036",
      "start_ms": 89600,
      "end_ms": 90485,
      "text": "一分不多拿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00037",
      "start_ms": 90710,
      "end_ms": 91730,
      "text": "有人看不下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00038",
      "start_ms": 91950,
      "end_ms": 92915,
      "text": "说你是校长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00039",
      "start_ms": 93670,
      "end_ms": 95365,
      "text": "怎么能跟学生拿一样多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00040",
      "start_ms": 95950,
      "end_ms": 97650,
      "text": "要给他涨到一千五百元。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00041",
      "start_ms": 97790,
      "end_ms": 98555,
      "text": "他不同意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00042",
      "start_ms": 99290,
      "end_ms": 100930,
      "text": "说薪水是我自己定的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00043",
      "start_ms": 100930,
      "end_ms": 103820,
      "text": "我不情愿改他租的公寓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00044",
      "start_ms": 103820,
      "end_ms": 106335,
      "text": "小到连一间单独的卧室都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00045",
      "start_ms": 107130,
      "end_ms": 111445,
      "text": "他夫人韩永华呢六十二岁才开始在美国找工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00046",
      "start_ms": 112270,
      "end_ms": 115215,
      "text": "衣帽厂做过工首饰店卖过货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00047",
      "start_ms": 115660,
      "end_ms": 116785,
      "text": "医院里做过护工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00048",
      "start_ms": 117100,
      "end_ms": 119455,
      "text": "最后在一所盲童学校照料盲童，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00049",
      "start_ms": 119890,
      "end_ms": 121850,
      "text": "一直干到六十六岁才退休。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00050",
      "start_ms": 122550,
      "end_ms": 125570,
      "text": "他自己呢住院的时候连医药费都付不起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00051",
      "start_ms": 125890,
      "end_ms": 130050,
      "text": "去世后丧葬费都是清华校友凑的这就是梅一期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00052",
      "start_ms": 130290,
      "end_ms": 131170,
      "text": "他不是没钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00053",
      "start_ms": 131770,
      "end_ms": 133930,
      "text": "他是把钱全给了学校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00054",
      "start_ms": 134210,
      "end_ms": 135010,
      "text": "给了学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00055",
      "start_ms": 135430,
      "end_ms": 137530,
      "text": "一分钱没往自己兜里装。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00056",
      "start_ms": 138330,
      "end_ms": 139490,
      "text": "再说他怎么用人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00057",
      "start_ms": 139890,
      "end_ms": 142190,
      "text": "那才叫真正的不拘一格。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00058",
      "start_ms": 143730,
      "end_ms": 145690,
      "text": "华罗庚什么学历？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00059",
      "start_ms": 145690,
      "end_ms": 150480,
      "text": "初中毕业在江苏金坛老家的药费殿伙计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00060",
      "start_ms": 150560,
      "end_ms": 152400,
      "text": "一边站柜台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00061",
      "start_ms": 152400,
      "end_ms": 153960,
      "text": "一边自学数学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00062",
      "start_ms": 153960,
      "end_ms": 155820,
      "text": "就这么一个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00063",
      "start_ms": 155820,
      "end_ms": 157720,
      "text": "梅一其看上了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00064",
      "start_ms": 158220,
      "end_ms": 160340,
      "text": "先把他破格招进清华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00065",
      "start_ms": 160880,
      "end_ms": 165200,
      "text": "又破格从一个系资料员直接升为助教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00066",
      "start_ms": 165540,
      "end_ms": 167780,
      "text": "还允许他旁听大学课程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00067",
      "start_ms": 168180,
      "end_ms": 171600,
      "text": "再破格送到英国剑桥大学深造。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00068",
      "start_ms": 171700,
      "end_ms": 172400,
      "text": "最后这一步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00069",
      "start_ms": 172400,
      "end_ms": 177660,
      "text": "最难得跳过讲师副教授直接聘为正教授。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00070",
      "start_ms": 178140,
      "end_ms": 179575,
      "text": "一个初中毕业的店员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00071",
      "start_ms": 180030,
      "end_ms": 184235,
      "text": "在每一期手里一步步变成了世界级的数学大师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00072",
      "start_ms": 184740,
      "end_ms": 187540,
      "text": "还有陈寅恪留学多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00073",
      "start_ms": 187740,
      "end_ms": 188605,
      "text": "没有学位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00074",
      "start_ms": 188890,
      "end_ms": 189695,
      "text": "没有著作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00075",
      "start_ms": 190100,
      "end_ms": 192045,
      "text": "在国内也没什么名气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00076",
      "start_ms": 192930,
      "end_ms": 195920,
      "text": "典型的三无学者没一齐主持。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00077",
      "start_ms": 195920,
      "end_ms": 197125,
      "text": "清华教务期间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00078",
      "start_ms": 197900,
      "end_ms": 206500,
      "text": "陈寅恪被聘为清华国学研究院导师和王国维、梁启超、赵元任并称四大导师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00079",
      "start_ms": 206720,
      "end_ms": 207100,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00080",
      "start_ms": 207100,
      "end_ms": 209160,
      "text": "傅斯年评价陈寅恪说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00081",
      "start_ms": 209160,
      "end_ms": 212165,
      "text": "他是近三百年来一人而已。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00082",
      "start_ms": 213040,
      "end_ms": 214755,
      "text": "每一期常说一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00083",
      "start_ms": 215380,
      "end_ms": 216505,
      "text": "所谓大学者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00084",
      "start_ms": 216850,
      "end_ms": 218390,
      "text": "非未有大楼之谓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00085",
      "start_ms": 218390,
      "end_ms": 220575,
      "text": "也有大师之谓也。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00086",
      "start_ms": 221050,
      "end_ms": 223110,
      "text": "翻译过来就是一个大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00087",
      "start_ms": 223110,
      "end_ms": 223630,
      "text": "行不行？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00088",
      "start_ms": 223830,
      "end_ms": 225235,
      "text": "不看你楼盖多高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00089",
      "start_ms": 225540,
      "end_ms": 226735,
      "text": "看你有没有好老师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00090",
      "start_ms": 227540,
      "end_ms": 228580,
      "text": "他不光这么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00091",
      "start_ms": 228820,
      "end_ms": 229825,
      "text": "他真这么干。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00092",
      "start_ms": 230240,
      "end_ms": 231080,
      "text": "教授开会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00093",
      "start_ms": 231280,
      "end_ms": 232865,
      "text": "他搬个凳子坐墙角，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00094",
      "start_ms": 233410,
      "end_ms": 233970,
      "text": "不说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00095",
      "start_ms": 234190,
      "end_ms": 235430,
      "text": "手里摆弄个烟斗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00096",
      "start_ms": 235530,
      "end_ms": 236815,
      "text": "看谁茶杯空了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00097",
      "start_ms": 237130,
      "end_ms": 238495,
      "text": "起身给人续上水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00098",
      "start_ms": 239030,
      "end_ms": 241300,
      "text": "有人问他校长有什么指示，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00099",
      "start_ms": 241360,
      "end_ms": 243845,
      "text": "他摆摆手说你们都是专家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00100",
      "start_ms": 244200,
      "end_ms": 246615,
      "text": "你们定的是我去办就完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00101",
      "start_ms": 247560,
      "end_ms": 250705,
      "text": "就这么一个给教授搬板凳的校长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00102",
      "start_ms": 251490,
      "end_ms": 253735,
      "text": "在抗战最艰难的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00103",
      "start_ms": 254780,
      "end_ms": 259130,
      "text": "带着清华北大南开三所学校一路南迁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00104",
      "start_ms": 259310,
      "end_ms": 262385,
      "text": "到昆明组成了西南联合大学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00105",
      "start_ms": 263110,
      "end_ms": 264745,
      "text": "那学校破到什么程度？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00106",
      "start_ms": 265080,
      "end_ms": 268595,
      "text": "请了梁思成林徽因来设计校舍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00107",
      "start_ms": 268970,
      "end_ms": 271065,
      "text": "图纸改了一稿又一稿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00108",
      "start_ms": 271470,
      "end_ms": 272505,
      "text": "高楼改矮楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00109",
      "start_ms": 272840,
      "end_ms": 273965,
      "text": "矮楼改平房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00110",
      "start_ms": 274320,
      "end_ms": 275665,
      "text": "砖墙改土墙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00111",
      "start_ms": 276080,
      "end_ms": 278420,
      "text": "最后建起来的是一排排茅草屋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00112",
      "start_ms": 278720,
      "end_ms": 280075,
      "text": "宿舍是茅草顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00113",
      "start_ms": 280410,
      "end_ms": 281825,
      "text": "教室是铁皮顶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00114",
      "start_ms": 282120,
      "end_ms": 283165,
      "text": "昆明一下雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00115",
      "start_ms": 283430,
      "end_ms": 284610,
      "text": "雨点打在铁皮上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00116",
      "start_ms": 284610,
      "end_ms": 287630,
      "text": "噼里啪啦老师在讲台上喊破嗓子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00117",
      "start_ms": 287850,
      "end_ms": 289315,
      "text": "学生一个字听不见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00118",
      "start_ms": 290160,
      "end_ms": 290720,
      "text": "有一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00119",
      "start_ms": 290720,
      "end_ms": 292880,
      "text": "经济系教授陈戴孙上课，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00120",
      "start_ms": 293360,
      "end_ms": 294320,
      "text": "暴雨突至，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00121",
      "start_ms": 294600,
      "end_ms": 295945,
      "text": "什么都听不清了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00122",
      "start_ms": 296650,
      "end_ms": 300065,
      "text": "陈先生转过身在黑板上写了四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00123",
      "start_ms": 300870,
      "end_ms": 302495,
      "text": "停客赏语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00124",
      "start_ms": 303360,
      "end_ms": 305835,
      "text": "全班师生就这么静静的坐着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00125",
      "start_ms": 307090,
      "end_ms": 310510,
      "text": "听外面的雨声就是这么一所破破烂烂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00126",
      "start_ms": 310790,
      "end_ms": 313030,
      "text": "连个像样的教室都没有的大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00127",
      "start_ms": 313110,
      "end_ms": 314810,
      "text": "只存在了短短八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00128",
      "start_ms": 315090,
      "end_ms": 316490,
      "text": "创造了什么奇迹？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00129",
      "start_ms": 317030,
      "end_ms": 324930,
      "text": "两位诺贝尔物理学奖得主杨振宁、李政道八位、两弹一星功勋奖章获得者、五位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00130",
      "start_ms": 324970,
      "end_ms": 330730,
      "text": "国家最高科学技术奖得主一百七十多位两院院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00131",
      "start_ms": 331470,
      "end_ms": 338480,
      "text": "还有上百位人文社科大师汪曾祺许愿冲邓稼先。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00132",
      "start_ms": 339340,
      "end_ms": 341360,
      "text": "一个个名字到今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00133",
      "start_ms": 341400,
      "end_ms": 343520,
      "text": "念起来都沉甸甸的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00134",
      "start_ms": 344820,
      "end_ms": 349080,
      "text": "中国教育史上的珠穆朗玛峰是在茅草屋里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00135",
      "start_ms": 350180,
      "end_ms": 353940,
      "text": "铁皮顶下战乱中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00136",
      "start_ms": 353960,
      "end_ms": 357220,
      "text": "被梅一齐带着一群人扛起来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00137",
      "start_ms": 358200,
      "end_ms": 359200,
      "text": "一九六一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00138",
      "start_ms": 359960,
      "end_ms": 363980,
      "text": "梅一齐因为重病住进台大医院特二号病房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00139",
      "start_ms": 364800,
      "end_ms": 367285,
      "text": "隔壁特一号病房住的是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00140",
      "start_ms": 367650,
      "end_ms": 368150,
      "text": "胡适，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00141",
      "start_ms": 368650,
      "end_ms": 370135,
      "text": "一个曾经主持北大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00142",
      "start_ms": 370380,
      "end_ms": 373535,
      "text": "一个长期主持清华两位老校长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00143",
      "start_ms": 374470,
      "end_ms": 378065,
      "text": "晚年住进了一墙之隔的两个病房。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00144",
      "start_ms": 379020,
      "end_ms": 380480,
      "text": "一九六二年二月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00145",
      "start_ms": 380740,
      "end_ms": 383280,
      "text": "胡适先走了不到三个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00146",
      "start_ms": 383500,
      "end_ms": 384525,
      "text": "五月十九日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00147",
      "start_ms": 384940,
      "end_ms": 386065,
      "text": "梅一起也走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00148",
      "start_ms": 386460,
      "end_ms": 387385,
      "text": "他去世后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00149",
      "start_ms": 387750,
      "end_ms": 390395,
      "text": "两岸、清华各建了一座梅园。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00150",
      "start_ms": 391070,
      "end_ms": 391970,
      "text": "每年冬天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00151",
      "start_ms": 392170,
      "end_ms": 393605,
      "text": "新竹的梅花开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00152",
      "start_ms": 393940,
      "end_ms": 396865,
      "text": "北京的梅园里也常有师生驻足。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00153",
      "start_ms": 397540,
      "end_ms": 400235,
      "text": "现在咱们的大学楼越盖越高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00154",
      "start_ms": 400530,
      "end_ms": 401735,
      "text": "设备越来越先进，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00155",
      "start_ms": 402160,
      "end_ms": 404410,
      "text": "经费越来越多可。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00156",
      "start_ms": 404410,
      "end_ms": 405395,
      "text": "有时候我就想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00157",
      "start_ms": 405950,
      "end_ms": 407325,
      "text": "我们到底缺什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00158",
      "start_ms": 408120,
      "end_ms": 409755,
      "text": "我们缺的不是大楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00159",
      "start_ms": 410340,
      "end_ms": 411265,
      "text": "不是经费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00160",
      "start_ms": 411910,
      "end_ms": 413950,
      "text": "是梅一齐身上那点东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00161",
      "start_ms": 414230,
      "end_ms": 414670,
      "text": "那点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00162",
      "start_ms": 414670,
      "end_ms": 416545,
      "text": "把公家的钱当命看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00163",
      "start_ms": 416950,
      "end_ms": 418805,
      "text": "把自己的日子当草过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00164",
      "start_ms": 419310,
      "end_ms": 421435,
      "text": "把人才当天大的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00165",
      "start_ms": 422290,
      "end_ms": 424415,
      "text": "把原则当命根子的劲儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00166",
      "start_ms": 424730,
      "end_ms": 426535,
      "text": "他用一辈子告诉后人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00167",
      "start_ms": 426880,
      "end_ms": 428700,
      "text": "什么都可以向现实低头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00168",
      "start_ms": 428780,
      "end_ms": 430810,
      "text": "唯独读书人的风骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00169",
      "start_ms": 430810,
      "end_ms": 431145,
      "text": "不能。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00170",
      "start_ms": 431860,
      "end_ms": 434355,
      "text": "如果你也被梅校长的故事戳到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00171",
      "start_ms": 434760,
      "end_ms": 438835,
      "text": "想知道那批读书人在战火里到底是怎么活过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00172",
      "start_ms": 439240,
      "end_ms": 440675,
      "text": "怎么把书教下去的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00173",
      "start_ms": 441090,
      "end_ms": 442870,
      "text": "我真心推荐你看看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00174",
      "start_ms": 442870,
      "end_ms": 449195,
      "text": "南渡北归、这套书、梅一齐陈银雀、华罗庚、梁思成林徽因，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00175",
      "start_ms": 449590,
      "end_ms": 451465,
      "text": "还有西南联大那批先生们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00176",
      "start_ms": 451920,
      "end_ms": 453915,
      "text": "书里写的比我讲的细多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00177",
      "start_ms": 454460,
      "end_ms": 455985,
      "text": "那不是一个人的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00178",
      "start_ms": 456410,
      "end_ms": 461425,
      "text": "是整整一代中国读书人在乱世里的群像。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00179",
      "start_ms": 462420,
      "end_ms": 463700,
      "text": "他们住茅草屋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00180",
      "start_ms": 463760,
      "end_ms": 465065,
      "text": "吃白饭拌辣椒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00181",
      "start_ms": 465350,
      "end_ms": 467125,
      "text": "可脊梁骨挺的比谁都直。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00182",
      "start_ms": 467720,
      "end_ms": 468715,
      "text": "看完你就明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00183",
      "start_ms": 469230,
      "end_ms": 473515,
      "text": "为什么那所破破烂烂的大学能走出那么多大师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00184",
      "start_ms": 474020,
      "end_ms": 476700,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友们可以点左下角链接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00185",
      "start_ms": 476860,
      "end_ms": 477535,
      "text": "直接拍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00186",
      "start_ms": 478100,
      "end_ms": 478785,
      "text": "拿到手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00187",
      "start_ms": 479130,
      "end_ms": 481160,
      "text": "细细品读关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00188",
      "start_ms": 481320,
      "end_ms": 483975,
      "text": "带你看更多有骨气的中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00189",
      "start_ms": 484570,
      "end_ms": 487125,
      "text": "觉得梅校长值得被记住的点个赞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00190",
      "start_ms": 487460,
      "end_ms": 488225,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00191",
      "start_ms": 488720,
      "end_ms": 489660,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00192",
      "start_ms": 489660,
      "end_ms": 490875,
      "text": "你最佩服他哪一点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00193",
      "start_ms": 491330,
      "end_ms": 492390,
      "text": "再转发出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1129e03ac0ecf7a8_s00194",
      "start_ms": 492630,
      "end_ms": 496555,
      "text": "让更多人知道中国曾经有过这样的校长。"
    }
  ],
